+### Finding D3: Native Child Argument Preservation (`CommandLineToArgvW`)
+- **Files Modified:**
+  - [`scripts/drive/mount_drive.ps1`](file:///D:/Class/movie-rcm-system/scripts/drive/mount_drive.ps1)
+- **Problem:**
